~ wall_caretaker
if wall_has_warning()
	Iddin-Sin: Raider tracks have been spotted nearby. They are nearing the castle. Prepare the wall.
	=> wall_work
elif wall_is_attacking()
	=> wall_work
else
	Iddin-Sin: Good to see you. Shall we look at the city's defences?
	=> wall_work

~ wall_work
if wall_is_attacking()
	Iddin-Sin: The raiders are still here. We can repair the wall once they leave.
else
	Iddin-Sin: {{wall_work_summary()}}
- Build [if wall_work_available() and wall_uses_timed_work() and wall_needs_build()]
	do wall_select_work()
	=> END
- Repair [if wall_work_available() and wall_uses_timed_work() and not wall_needs_build()]
	do wall_select_work()
	=> END
- Repair wall (free) [if wall_work_available() and not wall_uses_timed_work()]
	do wall_select_work()
	=> END
- Improve [if wall_improvements_available()]
	=> wall_improve_options
- Not now
	do wall_select_leave()
	=> END

~ wall_improve_options
Iddin-Sin: Choose a defence project to review.
- Wall Lv. 2 [if wall_upgrade_available()]
	do wall_select_upgrade()
	=> wall_improvement_quote
- Watchtower [if wall_watchtower_available()]
	do wall_select_watchtower()
	=> wall_improvement_quote
- Back
	do wall_select_leave()
	=> wall_work

~ wall_improvement_quote
Iddin-Sin: {{wall_improvement_quote_summary()}}
- Start [if wall_quote_can_start()]
	do wall_select_quoted_work()
	=> END
- Back
	do wall_cancel_improvement_quote()
	=> wall_improve_options
